    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At Bian Yong’ai’s restaurant, there is a kind offer: free egg pancakes for anyone in need. A sign says, “If life is hard for you in Shanghai, just ask for a free meal. When things get better, please help others.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Bian has kept this "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "promise",
            "ref": "v-promise"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for over three years. The egg pancakes are simple but filling. To make people feel comfortable, customers often call it “Set Meal A”—like a secret code."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One day, a couple asked for the free pancakes. Bian nodded and made two fresh ones for them. While cooking, she joked, “Let me check how much money you have in Alipay!” They all laughed. Later, she found the couple had actually paid for their meal."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Bian says many people are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "curious",
            "ref": "v-curious"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about “Set Meal A”. In today’s busy world, people sometimes "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "doubt",
            "ref": "v-doubt"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " such kindness. But she believes being honest and caring is the best way to do business."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Her kindness has "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "inspired"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " others. Once, a customer paid 650 "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "yuan"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for a meal. Bian returned the money, but the customer called back, saying he really wanted to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "donate",
            "ref": "v-donate"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Small acts of warmth like this happen all over Shanghai, making the city a kinder place."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
